# Python API

Module: `fathomdb`. Authoritative spec:
[`dev/interfaces/python.md`](https://github.com/coreyt/fathomdb/blob/main/dev/interfaces/python.md).

## Top-level

```python
from fathomdb import (
    Engine,
    EngineConfig,
    IdSpace,
    NodeRecord,
    OpStoreRow,
    ProjectionDelta,
    ProjectionRole,
    ProjectionSpec,
    SearchFilter,
    SearchHit,
